51
00:05:10.854 --> 00:05:16.484
So, Leslie, any rumblings
about which way Sam's leaning?

52
00:05:16.568 --> 00:05:19.571
Not a peep,
and I'm trying to play it chill.

53
00:05:20.113 --> 00:05:23.533
