I just give him a cool nod.

54
00:05:23.617 --> 00:05:24.993
You know, like this.

55
00:05:25.827 --> 00:05:27.913
Oh, shit. That was cool.

56
00:05:27.996 --> 00:05:30.081
I know, right?
I saw it in a Denzel Washington movie,

57
00:05:30.165 --> 00:05:32.334
