beating Brentford.

79
00:06:25.512 --> 00:06:28.265
Yes, because if we lose, it will kill me.

80
00:06:28.848 --> 00:06:30.267
Please don't lose, Ted. I beg you.

81
00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.602
Hey, don't you worry, Hig Newton.
I'm on it like a bonnet.

82
00:06:32.686 --> 00:06:35.063
Oh, God. These taste like shit.

83
00:06:35.146 --> 00:06:38.733
Oh, yeah. Well, it was a rough night,
and I am now absolutely positive that

84
00:06:38.817 --> 00:06:40.610
I switched the salt and sugar.
I'm sorry about that.

85
00:06:42.153 --> 00:06:43.321
No, no, no.

86
00:06:44.614 --> 00:06:45.907
No, it's interesting.

87
00:06:48.618 --> 00:06:51.037
She's a sneaky, salty bitch.

88
00:06:51.788 --> 00:06:53.748
Like Heather Locklear
on Melrose Place, right?

89
00:06:53.832 --> 00:06:55.542
-Oh, yeah.
-Yeah.

90
00:06:55.625 --> 00:06:56.459
