91
00:06:56.543 --> 00:06:58.545
-That's exactly how you'd describe her.
-Yeah.

92
00:06:58.628 --> 00:06:59.629
Oh, Heather.

93
00:06:59.713 --> 00:07:00.714
Hello.

94
00:07:00.797 --> 00:07:02.841
