102
00:08:02.734 --> 00:08:04.444
Yes. It's awful.

103
00:08:04.527 --> 00:08:07.864
-Yeah.
-Yeah. It was awful.

104
00:08:10.784 --> 00:08:11.785
Yeah.

105
00:08:13.703 --> 00:08:14.663
