155
00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:50.068
But I chose not to tell y'all,
and that was dumb.

156
00:10:51.319 --> 00:10:54.531
You know, fellas, we make a lot of choices
in our lives every single day,

157
00:10:54.614 --> 00:10:58.285
