171
00:11:46.124 --> 00:11:48.126
Now, I hope y'all can forgive me
for what I've done.

172
00:11:48.835 --> 00:11:50.212
'Cause I sure as heck wouldn't want

173
00:11:50.295 --> 00:11:51.922
