174
00:11:52.005 --> 00:11:54.049
-Nah, we got you, Coach. We got you.
-We got you, Coach.

175
00:11:55.342 --> 00:11:56.343
Yeah, no problem, gaffer.

176
00:11:56.927 --> 00:11:58.428
