190
00:12:27.582 --> 00:12:29.376
-Yeah, I got one.
-Yeah, Jamie, what do you got?

191
00:12:30.126 --> 00:12:31.753
What are we gonna do
with that fucking thing there?

192
00:12:36.383 --> 00:12:37.759
Yeah, that's a good point. Okay.

193
00:12:37.842 --> 00:12:39.928
Well, tell you what,
let's all head to the north field,

194
00:12:40.011 --> 00:12:42.889
