211
00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:35.650
No. Could you give us a minute, please?

212
00:13:35.734 --> 00:13:36.943
Sure.

213
00:13:38.862 --> 00:13:40.030
Wow.

214
00:13:41.698 --> 00:13:43.450
Nice to meet you.

215
00:13:45.994 --> 00:13:46.995
Something wrong?

216
00:13:48.038 --> 00:13:52.167
Actually, something is incredibly right.

217
00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:55.587
The money people that back Bantr,

218
